Z||000001||Oreif||11-21-2001||08:21 AM||||"Bump" is used to move a thread to the top of the list so more people can see it.||||reg||1
Z||000002||JohnF||11-21-2001||08:22 AM||||Any reply to a post will place that post on top.  A "bump" post will usually be made to move the original post up on the list for more people to see it and, possibly, respond. <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1578096&a=12001112&p=56509969&Sequence=0"> ||||reg||1
